The '''Lagoon Cave''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Black Lagoon}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
Throughout the '''Lagoon Cave''' is a parkour course which leads all the way from the area's entrance in the [[Black Lagoon]] until the end of the cave. There are platforms made of {{Item|Polished Granite|link=}} on which the player must traverse the cave. If the player comes in contact with the dirt or water below the platforms they will be teleported to the beginning and must start again.

At the end of the parkour is an [[Enigma Soul]] and a {{ID|Teleport Pad!Teleport Pad|nolink=true}} leading {{mctxt|f|Out!|size=11}} which when stepped on will teleport the player back to the entrance of the '''Lagoon Cave'''.

